function applyPlotInventory(kind,name,target=plotTarget){if(!target||stockLeft(kind,name)<1)return toast('背包里已经没有'+name);const n=target.dataset.index;if(kind==='seed'){const cropName=name.replace(/种子$/,'');if(target.dataset.crop)return toast('请先铲除原有作物');target.dataset.crop=cropName;target.dataset.days=cropDays(cropName);actions.push('在第'+n+'格农田播种'+cropName);animateSoil(target);toast('已从背包取出'+name)}else{if(target.dataset.fertilizer)return toast('这格已经施过肥');target.dataset.fertilizer=name;actions.push('给第'+n+'格农田施用'+name);animateSoil(target);toast('已从背包取出'+name)}renderSoil(target);updateFieldInfo();sync();if(kind==='seed'&&stockLeft('seed',name)===0&&fieldTool==='seed')setFieldTool('view');if(kind==='fertilizer'&&stockLeft('fertilizer',name)===0&&fertilizerChoice===name){fertilizerChoice='';setFieldTool('view')}if($('#fieldModal').classList.contains('show'))drawPlotModal()}
